:"c-shiji-032-qi:p043","quote":"四十一年，秦穆公虜晉惠公，復歸之。是歲，管仲、隰朋皆卒。管仲病，桓公問曰：「群臣誰可相者？」管仲曰：「知臣莫如君。」公曰：「易牙如何？」對曰：「殺子以適君，非人情，不可。」公曰：「開方如何？」對曰：「倍親以適君，非人情，難近。」公曰：「豎刀如何？」對曰：「自宮以適君，非人情，難親。」管仲死，而桓公不用管仲言，卒近用三子，三子專權。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p049","quote":"十年，孝公卒，孝公弟潘因衛公子開方殺孝公子而立潘，是為昭公。昭公，桓公子也，其母曰葛嬴。"}],"rationale":"按本篇小白立桓公、管仲任政、葵丘盟會及齊君／母親的明示敘事相接暫定；魯與齊的同號君主、同氏女性分開，不作全庫字串合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p043","text":"四十一年，秦穆公虜晉惠公，復歸之。是歲，管仲、隰朋皆卒。管仲病，桓公問曰：「群臣誰可相者？」管仲曰：「知臣莫如君。」公曰：「易牙如何？」對曰：「殺子以適君，非人情，不可。」公曰：「開方如何？」對曰：「倍親以適君，非人情，難近。」公曰：「豎刀如何？」對曰：「自宮以適君，非人情，難親。」管仲死，而桓公不用管仲言，卒近用三子，三子專權。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"秦穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"晉惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"a9v_t0d_3va","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"h1v_8ap_b9y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"隰朋","kind":"person","person_id":"p1q_4ay_bht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"h1v_8ap_b9y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"h1v_8ap_b9y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"易牙","kind":"person","person_id":"3lq_bkx_u08","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m043-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"開方","kind":"person","person_id":"j0b_1s6_k98","statu